countries.geojson is derived from Natural Earth's "Admin 0 - Countries"
dataset at 1:110m scale (ne_110m_admin_0_countries, version 5.1.x, from
https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector). Only the NAME, ISO_A3
(ADM0_A3 where ISO_A3 is -99), CONTINENT and POP_EST attributes were kept
and coordinates were rounded to 3 decimals.

places.geojson is derived from Natural Earth's "Populated Places" (simple) at
1:50m scale (ne_50m_populated_places_simple, same source). Only the name,
country (ADM0NAME), whether it is a national capital and POP_MAX were kept,
and coordinates were rounded to 4 decimals.

